# Shell scripts run under Linux (WSL, CI) and Git Bash: LF in every
# checkout, a Windows one with core.autocrlf included, or sh rejects them
*.sh text eol=lf

# Read by Linux tools from this tree (the linux skill syncs a Windows
# checkout into WSL): a CR ends linuxdeploy's Icon= value and pkg-config's
# Libs with a stray byte
*.desktop text eol=lf
*.pc.in text eol=lf
